<title>UK: London silver fixes sharply lower, gold also easier.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes sharply lower, gold also easier.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixes at 468.00 cents versus 483.75 previously following Friday's sharp sell-off.</p>
<p>GOLD - Weaker at $341.50/$342.00, down $3 from Friday close and nearly $2 off from AM fixing. Testing $342.00 support area.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Ticking lower at $387.75/$388.75, down $3.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Just easier at $170.25/$171.25.</p>
</text>
